Z||000010||87PegasusGT||05-16-2000||01:22 PM||||Don't have time slips but I picked the car up last night. Suffice it to sat that, come Midnight, I was STILL driving it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> It isn't blindingly fast, but I didn't expect it to be. The 3.4 is just a base for me. I still need to add the chip and muffler, but it was very definitley faster. It hit 100 in 3rd gear and reached 120 a LOT faster. In fact, it had the same acceleration in 3rd as it used to have in second and 4th gear was like 3rd. I still need to see how fast it tops out at, but as is, it feels alot faster than my old Iroc. I was able to chirp the tires going 45.||||reg||1
Z||000011||1FST2M6||05-16-2000||01:36 PM||||8.5 on nitrous.. I can do that.. it's not much better than a stock cobra.. @ 9.2. I'd be disappointed. but 7.2! OH YEAH! THATS HP! wish i had that much go!  <A HREF="http://www.engineered.net/cobra_page.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.engineered.net/cobra_page.htm</A>   <P>what tranny do you have mated to your new 3.4? <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 05-16-2000).]||||reg||1
