Z||000015||87PegasusGT||05-17-2000||01:28 PM||||The 3.4 is broken in because it actually has 14K original miles already. I had a local shop rebuild my tranny and it cost $$$. Labor cost me $900, engine cost me $630, other parts (used new instead of ones from 2.8) cost $1000. I have a list but not infront of me, but it included new tranny mounts, water pump, manifold, and flywheel.||||reg||1
